# Build context is the repository root for all three Dockerfiles.
#
# **/node_modules is load-bearing: without it, angular.Dockerfile's host-side
# node_modules would clobber the freshly `npm ci`-installed tree in its image.
#
# Do NOT add `**/*.jar` - it would strip spring-petclinic-rest's
# maven-wrapper.jar and break the REST build confusingly.

.git
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/.angular
**/out-tsc
**/coverage
spring-petclinic-angular/docs
playwright/test-results
playwright/playwright-report
playwright/blob-report
**/*.log

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
